{
    "title": "Kuku FM: Audio Series",
    "description": "Lose yourself in exclusive global audio stories & original audio shows on the world\u2019s favourite audio app. From enthralling tales to easy listening, from heartbreak to horror - there is a library for everyone. \r\n\r\nTreat your ears to the Kuku FM Experience\r\n\u2705 Exclusive access to Shows & Stories\r\n\u2705 Fresh new episodes daily, new shows weekly  \ud83e\udd73\r\n\u2705 Immersive & Cinematic Audio Experience\r\n\u2705 Unique characters you will love\r\n\u2705 No forced Ads, No Hidden Fee\r\n\u2705 Pay only for what you listen\r\n\u2705 Unlimited Downloads for Offline Listening\r\n\u2705 Enjoy safe on-the-go listening with Car Mode \r\n\r\nFall in love, live the drama!\r\nDive into a world of entertainment with unique characters and thrilling plot twists in stories of Love, Action, Crime, Horror or Drama. Listen to Luka\u2019s Redemption, Secret Billionaire, Timeless Healer, Checkmate Billionaire and many more.\r\n\r\nPick, Unlock & Enjoy\r\nExperience true freedom of choice & move between shows and episodes with your Kuku Coins.\r\n\r\nJump from the thrill of a murder mystery to the poetry of a tragic tale - simply tap your finger.\r\n\r\nEpisode 12 of Love to Hate You followed by Episode 23 of Doctor Miracle, MD? Your mood, your rules!\r\n\r\nGive your eyes a rest\r\nWho said you need to make time for entertainment? When you are on the move or at home,  traveling to a distant land or heading towards your dreamland every night, simply plug in Kuku FM and dive into an immersive world without disrupting your routine. \r\n\r\nGet access to this exclusive content by paying only for what you listen to. \r\n\r\nEasily discover new content with our curated recommendations and search function, and enjoy seamless playback on your phone.\r\n\r\n**First episodes free**\r\n**Free Coins on sign up & daily check in**\r\n\r\nGrab your one-way ticket to excitement and explore away!\r\n#WeakToStrong #Billionaire #ContractMarriage #MurderMystery \r\n#StarCrossed #CrimeOfPassion #MeetCute #ForeverLove #Supernatural #Horror #Fantasy #SecretLives\r\n\r\nAvailable on Android, iOS, Wear OS, TV, Jio, Samsung, Xiaomi, OPPO & more\r\nDownload Now\r\n\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://kukufm.com/privacy-policy\r\nTerms and Conditions: https://kukufm.com/terms-condition",
